%% Pronunciation job flow and Mediasoup sequence
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant API
  participant S3
  participant Queue
  participant Worker
  participant Inference
  participant LangTool
  participant Socket

  Client->>API: POST /upload-session (create session)
  API->>S3: create presigned URLs
  S3-->>Client: presigned URLs
  Client->>S3: upload chunks
  Client->>API: POST /upload-session/complete
  API->>Queue: enqueue PronunciationJob (S3 key)
  Queue-->>Worker: job delivered
  Worker->>S3: download audio
  Worker->>Worker: ffmpeg preprocess
  Worker->>Inference: call Whisper/ASR service
  Inference-->>Worker: transcript + timings
  Worker->>LangTool: grammar & style checks
  LangTool-->>Worker: grammar results
  Worker->>MongoDB: save analysis & update user profile
  Worker->>Socket: emit job:completed
  Socket-->>Client: notify completion
  Client->>API: GET /pronunciation/result
  API->>MongoDB: fetch result
  API-->>Client: return analysis


%% Mediasoup join flow
sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Socket
  participant Mediasoup

  Client->>Socket: join room request
  Socket->>Mediasoup: create Router (if needed)
  Socket->>Mediasoup: createTransport
  Mediasoup-->>Socket: transport params
  Socket-->>Client: transport params
  Client->>Mediasoup: connect transport + produce track
  Mediasoup-->>Socket: producer created
  Socket-->>OtherClients: new-producer event
  OtherClients->>Mediasoup: consume track
```